          "noteable_iid": 5678,
          "commands_changes": {}
        },
        {
          "id": 799016147,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "I think we currently handle that by using the wide API where we can, either directly or indirectly via GLib and Qt. This might let us get rid of the `setlocale(LC_ALL, \".UTF-8\")` calls in our various `main()`s, but I haven't tested that.\n\nI found out about the manifest setting via https://nullprogram.com/blog/2021/12/30/. It also recommends calling `SetConsoleOutputCP(CP_UTF8)`, which might give us a better fix for #16649, but I haven't tried that either.",
          "author": {
            "id": 860017,
            "username": "geraldcombs",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Gerald Combs",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://gitlab.com/uploads/-/system/user/avatar/860017/avatar.png?v=1789887783",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/geraldcombs"
